    dict(airport='Melbourne T2 (Mon 8 Feb, ~9pm-10:45pm)', lounge='Qantas International Business Lounge', access='yes', notes='Airside, level 1. Covered by the Business ticket. Melbourne Airport lists a 10:15pm Monday close, but Qantas says lounges stay open until the last departure and Monday QF49 is a new service from Dec 2026: re-check the hours in January and be at the gate by 10:45pm regardless.'),
