points = dict(balance=170000, availableFrom='2026-10-15', notes='Prices confirmed post-5 Aug 2025: NRT→BNE Business 82,100; HND/NRT→SYD/MEL Business 98,400; short domestic (Zone 1) economy 9,200 + ~A$58. Economy Tokyo→Brisbane is estimated at ~29,000 (Zone 5) and Tokyo→Sydney/Melbourne ~36,200 (Zone 6); the exact cells were not visible from here, confirm on qantas.com. Bronze members are last in the upgrade queue and are typically only considered inside 24 h of departure, so treat any upgrade as a bonus, not a plan. Qantas’ Flight Reward Finder can be searched without logging in; AwardFares has a free Qantas search with alerts.')

