  dict(id='ck9', group='Points and bookings', text='Travel insurance with the snow-sports add-on (and off-piste cover if you plan to ski Nozawa’s tree runs)', due='2026-11-30', notes='Standard Australian policies exclude skiing. About A$80 for a week before the add-on. Buy it when you book the first non-refundable thing so cancellation cover starts. Medicare does not cover Japan.'),
