  dict(id='ck12', group='Before you go', text='Install eSIM (Ubigi ~US$14 for 10 GB/7 days, or Airalo) and set up Welcome Suica Mobile (iPhone) or plan to buy a physical Welcome Suica at Narita (Android)', due='2027-01-31', notes='Suica works in Osaka (ICOCA area) and Nagano too. Google Wallet on non-Japanese Android phones generally cannot hold Suica; the physical Welcome Suica is cash top-up only and expires after 28 days, which is fine for this trip. Top up with Mastercard/Amex in Apple Wallet; some Visa cards fail.'),
